  m_text: I was going to take my girlfriend, sorry, ex-girlfriend with me. House
    was interesting but it also came with an unexpected guest that kept me company
    and played hide and seek! I had fun and forgot all about the breakup! (P.S I
    still miss you Diana! Come back to me >_<)
